  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf a monster(s) is Special Summoned by your
    Trap effect (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 card on the field;
    return it to the hand, then you can Special Summon this card. You can only use
    this effect of \"Vulmina, Statue of the Sacred Dragon\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster
    Effect ] \nWhen an opponent's monster declares an attack: You can place this
    monster in your Pendulum Zone, and if you do, return the opponent's monster to
    the hand. You can only use this effect of \"Vulmina, Statue of the Sacred Dragon\"
    once per turn. If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed: You can place this
    card in your Pendulum Zone."
